# will_mycology_forest — mycology finds something to do in an ordinary forest
#
# Mushrooms grow in a forest's woods and wet ground (the factory's clusters, and the wild growth of
# SceneFactory.PlaceWildGrowth), and mycology takes them by gathering — or by grabbing, which is what a
# cellar's man-made bed needs. Forest id 2, from the Clearing: a mushroom is right there.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm mycology --location-type forest --location-id 2 --start-area Clearing --period morning

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

expect-state will "will mycology steps=1"
expect-state will "gather a mushroom"
expect-state will "aim=1/3"
quit
